        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-09T17:44:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's see...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When I was very little, I collected marbles. &nbsp;Never played the game, just collected them.</p><p>For a while I was collecting foreign language Harry Potter books. &nbsp;I've mostly stopped, now, although I've still got the collection.</p><p>I have a collection of home-made paper stars that's 28,000 strong.</p><p>Now I'm collecting knitting patterns, although that's mostly by accident - people keep giving them to me, whether I want them or not!</p>",
