        "created_at": "2015-09-09T23:28:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pull tab/ring pulls from soda/beer cans. Started as a teenager for no apparent reason and I haven't saved any in years, but I still have thousands of them in the attic.</p><p>Now I'd have to say vegetable seed varieties, particularly peas, French beans, tomatoes and chillies. And I'm working on my collection of true potato seeds (as in real produced-from-a-fruit seeds rather than \"seed tubers\").</p>",
